    "Adds a drop shadow behind every icon-bearing tile. Has no visible effect on spacers and dividers.": {
      "comment": "A description of the shadow feature in the appearance settings.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在每个带图标图块的后方添加投影。对间隔块和分隔栏没有可见效果。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在每個帶圖示圖塊的後方新增投影。對間隔塊和分隔欄沒有可見效果。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在每個帶圖標圖塊的後方添加投影。對間隔塊和分隔欄沒有可見效果。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajoute une ombre portée derrière chaque tuile contenant une icône. Sans effet visible sur les espaces et séparateurs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a visual separator to break up sections in the dock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Añade un separador visual para dividir secciones del dock."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加视觉分隔线，用于划分 Dock 中的各个区域。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新增視覺分隔線，用於劃分 Dock 中的各個區域。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加視覺分隔線，用於劃分 Dock 中的各個區域。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajoute un séparateur visuel pour séparer les sections du dock."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds breathing room between pinned tiles or folders.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Añade espacio entre íconos fijados o carpetas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在固定的图块或文件夹之间留出间距。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在固定的圖塊或資料夾之間留出間距。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在固定的圖塊或文件夾之間留出間距。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajoute de l’espace entre les tuiles épinglées ou les dossiers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjusts how transparent the Launchpad backdrop is. Lower values darken the screen behind the grid; higher values let more of your desktop show through.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajusta la transparencia del fondo del Launchpad. Valores más bajos oscurecen la pantalla detrás de la cuadrícula; los más altos dejan ver más del escritorio."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整启动台背景的透明度。数值越低，网格后方的屏幕越暗；数值越高，越能透出更多桌面内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "調整啟動臺背景的透明度。數值越低，網格後方的螢幕越暗；數值越高，越能透出更多桌面內容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "調整啓動台背景的透明度。數值越低，網格後方的屏幕越暗；數值越高，越能透出更多桌面內容。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajuste la transparence de l'arrière-plan du Launchpad. Les valeurs basses assombrissent l'écran derrière la grille ; les valeurs hautes laissent voir davantage votre bureau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
