    "Dock profiles each keep their own pinned apps, trailing items, widgets, and hidden-app list. Switch between them from the small ball at the leading edge of the dock.": {
      "comment": "A description of how profiles work.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个 Dock 配置文件都保留自己的固定应用、尾部项目、小组件和隐藏应用列表。可通过 Dock 前缘的小球在它们之间切换。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每個 Dock 配置檔案都保留自己的固定應用、尾部專案、小元件和隱藏應用列表。可透過 Dock 前緣的小球在它們之間切換。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每個 Dock 配置文件都保留自己的固定應用、尾部項目、小組件和隱藏應用列表。可通過 Dock 前緣的小球在它們之間切換。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque profil de dock conserve ses propres applications épinglées, éléments finaux, widgets et liste d'applications masquées. Basculez entre eux depuis la petite bille au bord d'attaque du dock."
          }
        }
      }
    },
