    "Draws a rounded backdrop around the folder tile and its grouped opened apps. Turn off to keep the grouping without the visual halo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dibuja un fondo redondeado alrededor del ícono de carpeta y las apps abiertas agrupadas. Desactívalo para mantener la agrupación sin el halo visual."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在文件夹图块及其归组的已打开应用周围绘制圆角背景。关闭后可保留分组但不显示光晕效果。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在資料夾圖塊及其歸組的已開啟應用周圍繪製圓角背景。關閉後可保留分組但不顯示光暈效果。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在文件夾圖塊及其歸組的已打開應用周圍繪製圓角背景。關閉後可保留分組但不顯示光暈效果。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dessine un arrière-plan arrondi autour de la tuile de dossier et de ses applications ouvertes groupées. Désactivez pour conserver le groupement sans le halo visuel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
