    "How an app folder shows its apps' badges: one combined total on the folder tile, or a badge on each app inside it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用文件夹如何显示其中各应用的徽标：在文件夹图块上显示一个合并后的总数，或在文件夹内的每个应用上分别显示徽标。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "應用資料夾如何顯示其中各應用的徽標：在資料夾圖塊上顯示一個合併後的總數，或在資料夾內的每個應用上分別顯示徽標。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "應用文件夾如何顯示其中各應用的徽標：在文件夾圖塊上顯示一個合併後的總數，或在文件夾內的每個應用上分別顯示徽標。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comment un dossier d'applications affiche les badges de ses applications : un total combiné sur la tuile du dossier, ou un badge sur chaque application qu'il contient."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long the pointer must dwell at the screen edge before Docky reveals while a fullscreen app is active. Mirrors the macOS Dock's intent gating.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuánto debe permanecer el puntero en el borde de la pantalla antes de que Docky aparezca mientras hay una app en pantalla completa. Refleja la lógica de intención del Dock de macOS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在全屏应用处于活动状态时，指针需停留在屏幕边缘多久 Docky 才会显示。这与 macOS Dock 的意图门控一致。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在全屏應用處於活動狀態時，指標需停留在螢幕邊緣多久 Docky 才會顯示。這與 macOS Dock 的意圖門控一致。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在全屏應用處於活動狀態時，指針需停留在屏幕邊緣多久 Docky 才會顯示。這與 macOS Dock 的意圖門控一致。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Temps pendant lequel le pointeur doit rester au bord de l'écran avant que Docky ne se révèle lorsqu'une application est en plein écran. Suit la logique d'intention du Dock de macOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long the slide takes when Docky shows or hides its window. Set to 0 to snap instantly.": {
      "comment": "Rendered through a String-based path; not auto-extracted by Xcode.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Docky 显示或隐藏窗口时滑动的时长。设为 0 表示立即出现。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Docky 顯示或隱藏視窗時滑動的時長。設為 0 表示立即出現。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Docky 顯示或隱藏窗口時滑動的時長。設為 0 表示立即出現。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Durée du glissement lorsque Docky affiche ou masque sa fenêtre. Réglez sur 0 pour un déplacement instantané."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long to wait before the per-tile window preview appears when hovering an app or app folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuánto esperar antes de que aparezca la vista previa por ícono al pasar el cursor sobre una app o carpeta de apps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "悬停在应用或应用文件夹上后，窗口预览出现前的等待时长。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "懸停在應用或應用資料夾上後，視窗預覽出現前的等待時長。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "懸停在應用或應用文件夾上後，窗口預覽出現前的等待時長。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Durée d'attente avant l'apparition de l'aperçu de fenêtre par tuile lors du survol d'une application ou d'un dossier d'applications."
