    "Pin the active theme's icon for this app as your override. Without this, the theme icon already applies; pinning it preserves the choice if you switch themes.": {
      "comment": "A help text explaining how to use the \"Use Theme Icon\" button.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将当前主题的图标固定为此 App 的覆盖图标。不固定时主题图标也会生效；固定后即使切换主题也会保留此选择。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "將當前主題的圖示固定為此 App 的覆蓋圖示。不固定時主題圖示也會生效；固定後即使切換主題也會保留此選擇。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "將當前主題的圖標固定為此 App 的覆蓋圖標。不固定時主題圖標也會生效；固定後即使切換主題也會保留此選擇。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Épinglez l'icône du thème actif pour cette application comme substitution. Sans cela, l'icône du thème s'applique déjà ; l'épingler conserve ce choix si vous changez de thème."
          }
        }
      }
    },
