    "Widget bundles are loaded once per launch. New installs and removals take effect after a restart.": {
      "comment": "A description of how widget changes are applied after a restart.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小组件包每次启动仅加载一次。新安装和移除在重启后生效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小元件包每次啟動僅載入一次。新安裝和移除在重啟後生效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小組件包每次啓動僅加載一次。新安裝和移除在重啓後生效。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les bundles de widgets sont chargés une fois par lancement. Les nouvelles installations et suppressions prennent effet après un redémarrage."
          }
        }
      }
